<item>
<title>A typography regression article</title>
<link>https://example.org/blog/typography/</link>
<pubDate>Tue, 11 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
<guid>https://example.org/blog/typography/</guid>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Good documentation typography separates reading comfort from interface density.&#xA;The theme can evolve article prose without forcing the sidebar, search dialog,&#xA;or terminal components to use the same font.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;a-stable-foundation&#34;&gt;A stable foundation&#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Semantic roles reduce selector-level overrides and keep future editorial work&#xA;bounded. Code such as &lt;code&gt;hugo --minify&lt;/code&gt; remains visually distinct from prose.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
</item>
<item>
<title>An older regression article</title>
